{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼おかえりなさいませっきゃぴっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなこの写真を待ってただろうな\nはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n緊急決定！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北ＦＭ「DJ Tomoaki's Radio Show!」\n◆放送局：下北ＦＭ 88.8MHz\n◆日時：2013年4月4日(木)19:00～ ＜公開生放送＞\n◆メインMC：大蔵ともあき（下北ＦＭ）\n◆アシスタントMC：伊藤万理華、川村真洋（乃木坂46）\n◆場所：東京・下北沢駅南口\n「SFMホール(スタジオベイド下北沢店)」より公開生放送\n※チケット料金1500円（別途ドリンク代￥500）\n当日16時00分より会場にて先着100名様限定で販売いたします\n詳細はコチラ：http://www.shimokitafm.com/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、真洋と私がアシスタントMCを\n務めさせていただくことに\nなりました。\nぜひ来てください♪\n見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメのドルヲタかなりん\nひなぴょんのコメント見た？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た～♪2人ともいつもからかうし、\nほめてくれないから余計嬉しかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもどんな姿で家で\n過ごしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スウェット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールは\n何個の嘘にひっかかった？←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら嘘つかれてもないし、\n騙されもしなかったんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかそれどころじゃなかったよねw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれ変われるとしたら、\n何になりたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子かな。\nでも男の子にもなってみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかに妹いたら\nどんな姉になりそうですか？（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配性でおせっかいして\nウザがられそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトを好きになったきっかけは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生のトマトが食べられなかった\nんだけどね、ある時\n砂糖をかけたら美味しいことを\n知って、はまっちゃったの。\nそしたらなくても自然と\n食べられるようになってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容とか健康も気にしてたら余計に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて呼ばれるのが\n一番気に入ってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正式なあだ名がまりっかだから\n迷ったらまりっかって呼んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか気に入ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くてわからなかったから聞きたい\n書道でなにやった?＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜の花びらを散らせたよ。\nあと、生駒のフォローもしました！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の嵐がやってきた。\n私は家にこもってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は晴れるみたいで安心安心"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あの日見た花の名前を僕達はまだ知らない。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場版が早く観たすぎて\nうずうずうずうずしておる。\n予告で泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼べっ別にすきでハート作ったわけじゃないんだからねっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツンデレ。\n1枚目とキャラ違いすぎてはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日楽しみだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}